  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Stablecoin market cap rose 2.4% over 30D:</strong> Stablecoin market cap at $304.99B (2.4% higher over 30D) implies fresh dry powder entering crypto rails\u2014usually a constructive backdrop for settlement, trading, and on-chain cash demand. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/09/09/paypal-expands-stablecoin-rails-with-launch-of-custom-token-issuance-platform\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">PayPal expands stablecoin rails with custom token issuance platform</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Stablecoin market structure remains concentration-led:</strong> leadership is still defined by a small set of large issuers/platforms; share shifts matter as much as aggregate market-cap growth. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/09/08/u-s-bank-takes-next-step-towards-launching-its-stablecoin-with-cross-border-payment-test\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">U.S. Bank takes next step towards launching its stablecoin with cross-border payment test</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Bank rails are pushing stablecoins into treasury workflows:</strong> That pushes demand toward treasury and settlement use cases, not only exchange trading liquidity. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-bank-launches-usbdc-stablecoin-with-live-cross-border-payment?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">US Bank tests proprietary stablecoin in cross-border Stellar transaction</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
